Package: BH
Type: Package
Title: Boost C++ Header Files -- Metapackage
Version: 1.74.0-1
Date: 2018-02-12
Author: Dirk Eddelbuettel, John W. Emerson and Michael J. Kane
Maintainer: Dirk Eddelbuettel <edd@debian.org>
Description: Boost provides free peer-reviewed portable C++ source 
 libraries.  A large part of Boost is provided as C++ template code
 which is resolved entirely at compile-time without linking.  This 
 package aims to provide the most useful subset of Boost libraries 
 for template use among CRAN package. This package is actually empty
 as it isembedded in a virtual Debian/Ubuntu package pulling in
 libboost-all-dev for Boost itself.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Built: R 4.1.1; ; 'Tue, 31 Aug 2021 06:40:29 -0500'; unix
